      "a": "The federal government obligated $13.2B in NAICS 325412 contracts in FY2026 to date. Total obligations across the fiscal years shown were $19.5B in FY21, $34.4B in FY22, $12.8B in FY23, $10.1B in FY24, $13.1B in FY25, and $13.2B in FY26 to date. The market recorded 14,748 awards with an average award size of $892K and obligations were up 0.5% year over year."
